  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Size &amp; FitStandard fit is athletic and relaxed7-inch inseamProduct FeaturesLightweight, quick-drying poly construction for water-friendly comfortWavy pattern across the front and back borrows the motif from the iconic Air Max 95Nike Swoosh embroidered above the hem signs off the look with heritage styleBuilt-in mesh lining adds support and comfort for all-day wearElasticized waistband with a drawcord at the waist secures snug, personalized comfortSide pockets and an interior mesh pocket offer space to stash essentialsMachine washThe Nike Swim Breaker AM95 7\" Lined Volley Shorts are imported.Borrowing inspiration from an all-time sneaker, the Men's Nike Swim Breaker AM95 7\" Lined Volley Shorts are all about making waves. Wavy panels across the front and back, reminiscent of the instantly recognizable Air Max 95, showcase your sneakerhead status as you enjoy some fair-weather fun. Plus, an adjustable drawstring on the elastic waistband lets you lace up your trunks like you would a pair of Air Max 95s before stepping out the door.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Swim Breaker AM95 7\" Lined Volley Shorts</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Smoke Grey/Wolf Grey/Bleached Turquoise</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weig